WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.033
Hello, I'm going to show you our website.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:06.033
The title of the page is Mini Health Encyclopedia.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:10.698
On the main page, we can find a content index

00:00:10.698 --> 00:00:12.431
to navigate and jump to the section we're interested in.

00:00:12.431 --> 00:00:20.030
For example, we can go to the index in the search section, where we can choose a letter to see the corresponding articles.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:24.696
There’s also a tab with featured articles,

00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:29.361
and a site map where we can check all the information on the page.

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:36.027
We also find two forms, one if you haven’t found what you were looking for, and another to contact us.

00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:43.759
The page also includes an accessibility statement with all the guidelines it follows (as declared by the WCAG).

00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:51.757
Additionally, there are two PDFs to show what a properly accessible PDF would look like, and another showing improper accessibility.

00:00:51.757 --> 00:00:55.855
Let’s access the articles that start with the letter "E";

00:00:55.855 --> 00:01:01.060
in this case, there is only one article, which is about pregnancy.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:12.572
We can see in the breadcrumbs where we are on the website. In addition, most of the articles follow a similar structure,

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:23.017
where there’s an index that lets us jump to the section we're interested in, such as the description, causes, symptoms, or whatever we like.

00:01:23.017 --> 00:01:30.496
Moreover, in this particular article, we have a table that is fully usable and accessible.

00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:39.014
Also, this article includes an interactive map where we can select the part we’re interested in, and it will tell us more about it.

00:01:39.014 --> 00:01:46.410
At the end of the article, so that we don’t have to scroll all the way back up, we can click a button to return to the main page.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:54.011
In this mini-tutorial, as we’ve been navigating through the website, there’s still much more to explore.

00:01:54.011 --> 00:02:00.010
So, I invite you to visit our website and discover everything else that’s waiting to be seen.